OL,3,CFirst Minister reaffirms commitment to
OL,4,CMagee expansion amid funding concerns
OL,6,FMichelle O'Neill has restated her
OL,7,Fcommitment to the expansion of Ulster
OL,8,FUniversity's Londonderry campus amid
OL,9,Fconcerns about funding pressures.
OL,11,FThe First Minister said she will be
OL,12,Fputting Stormont's budgetary situation
OL,13,F"directly to Andy Burnham himself"
OL,14,Fwhen she meets the Prime Minister, and
OL,15,Fshe wants "fairness" for "all those in
OL,16,FMagee University".
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@bO]wD@KOUwD@TO]wD@ZOUxD@QO]
