OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786627119
OL,3,CFirst Minister reaffirms commitment to
OL,4,CMagee expansion amid funding concerns
OL,6,FAmbitious plans to build a
OL,7,Fmultimillion-pound 15,000 square metre
OL,8,FAir Dome on the Magee campus that had
OL,9,Fbeen hailed as "game-changing" for the
OL,10,Fnorth-west region were confirmed to
OL,11,Fhave been scrapped last week.
OL,13,FUlster University said the plan is "no
OL,14,Flonger financially viable within our
OL,15,Fcurrent context".
OL,17,FThe Department for the Economy
OL,18,Fdescribed the move as "disappointing"
OL,19,Fbut said Sinn Fein minister Caoimhe
OL,20,FArchibald "remains fully committed" to
OL,21,Fgrowing student numbers at the campus.
OL,26,@qD@POUqD@^O]uD@dOUwD@PO]zD@WOUzD@eO]{D@
OL,26,APrr|D@KOU|D@cO]
