OL,3,CFirst Minister reaffirms commitment to
OL,4,CMagee expansion amid funding concerns
OL,6,FExpanding the Magee site to 10,000
OL,7,Fstudent capacity was a central
OL,8,Fcommitment in the Executive's
OL,9,FProgramme for Government 2024-27.
OL,11,FSpeaking to reporters in Derry, the
OL,12,FFirst Minister was asked about the
OL,13,F"nervousness" in the city caused by
OL,14,Fplans being downgraded.
OL,16,FMs O'Neill said: "I am absolutely
OL,17,Fdetermined to the commitment that
OL,18,Fwe've made to Magee, and we've shown
OL,19,Fthat over the past two years.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@MO]xD@ROU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786627119
OL,3,CFirst Minister reaffirms commitment to
OL,4,CMagee expansion amid funding concerns
OL,6,F"A record investment in the Magee
OL,7,Fcampus, 22% increase in student
OL,8,Fnumbers. We're going to continue to
OL,9,Fbuild upon that.
OL,11,F"There's a lot of positivity around
OL,12,Fthe whole Magee campus, and I want us
OL,13,Fto build each step, continue to do
OL,14,Fthat positively, and I think we can do
OL,15,Fthat."But this goes right to the heart
OL,16,Fof the budgetary situation that we
OL,17,Ffind ourselves in.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@FOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786627119
OL,3,CFirst Minister reaffirms commitment to
OL,4,CMagee expansion amid funding concerns
OL,6,F"We want our funding so that we can
OL,7,Fgive our universities more money, that
OL,8,Fwe can put more money into our public
OL,9,Fservices, that's the battle that we
OL,10,Fnow are in with the British government
OL,11,Fwho thus far have underfunded us
OL,12,Fentirely.
OL,14,F"All of our public services, all of
OL,15,Four universities have all been
OL,16,Funderfunded for well over a decade.
OL,18,F"Whenever I get the chance, over the
OL,19,Fcoming weeks, I intend to put this
OL,20,Fdirectly to Andy Burnham himself, the
OL,21,Fnew British Prime Minister.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1786627119
OL,3,CFirst Minister reaffirms commitment to
OL,4,CMagee expansion amid funding concerns
OL,6,F"He's now taken up his new post, if he
OL,7,Fwants to make a difference, then start
OL,8,Flistening to the needs of our public
OL,9,Fservices. Stop underfunding us to the
OL,10,Ftune that you have done for many, many
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,F"What we want is fairness for all of
OL,14,Four people here, including for all
OL,15,Fthose in Magee University."
OL,17,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,18,FITVX
